   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1.1.A: Number of assessments (i) conducted on  transformative, gender-responsive climate actions in a landscape, food, or related systems identified through NDC and/or NAPs reviews and (ii) assessed through inclusive multi-stakeholder consultations  that address the needs and priorities of women and men

Indicator 2.1.A: Number of ministries having adopted sectoral plans and/or budget submissions that (i) incorporate gender-responsive NAPs and NDC land-use and agriculture priorities and (ii) are based on consultations that increase the participation of women and women&#x2019;s representatives in decision-making 

Indicator 2.1.B: Number of MRV and/or M&amp;E systems operationalised at national and/or sectoral level for monitoring and reporting on mitigation and/or adaptation in land-use and agriculture, including sex-disaggregated data  

Indicator 2.1.C: Number of NDCs and/or NAPs enhanced with updated land-use and agriculture priorities and gender-responsive targets 

Indicator 3.1.A: Number of gender-responsive de-risking strategies validated by existing institutional coalitions of public, civil society and private sector actors taking into account well-being of local communities/different actors along value chain)</narrative>
    </description>
